[E-PARSE] Error: a membership test in a `rewrite` needs brackets
   ╭─[ reject/logic-in-rewrite-rule.sw:6:15 ]
   │
 6 │   rewrite h 3 in xs in rfl
   │               ─┬    ─┬  
   │                ╰──────── this `in` ends the rewrite rule
   │                      │  
   │                      ╰── so this `in` is read as a membership test in the body
   │ 
   │ Note: a bare `in` ends a `rewrite` rule, so membership in a rule is written in brackets, `rewrite h (x in xs) in …`; a membership test as the body is bracketed too, `rewrite h in (x in xs)`
───╯
